{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396640/extras/803972c7b41b581271f74267fe940ed2.poster.avif?t=1755299245\" width=612 height=38 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396640/extras/803972c7b41b581271f74267fe940ed2.webm?t=1755299245\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396640/extras/803972c7b41b581271f74267fe940ed2.mp4?t=1755299245\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secret Paws - Cozy Apartments is a 3D hidden objects game where your mission is to find over 1000 cats hidden in cozy and cluttered apartments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396640/extras/9edb5aeb337aa5b5cc69dfebbfcc3e2e.poster.avif?t=1755299245\" width=610 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396640/extras/9edb5aeb337aa5b5cc69dfebbfcc3e2e.webm?t=1755299245\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396640/extras/9edb5aeb337aa5b5cc69dfebbfcc3e2e.mp4?t=1755299245\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open drawers, safes, cabinets, and move objects to uncover the most unexpected hiding spots. Every corner of the apartment holds surprises and challenges as you explore a richly detailed isometric environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396640/extras/8d9d800d75e083a1a12a848e430548fd.poster.avif?t=1755299245\" width=610 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396640/extras/8d9d800d75e083a1a12a848e430548fd.webm?t=1755299245\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396640/extras/8d9d800d75e083a1a12a848e430548fd.mp4?t=1755299245\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With secret cats and intriguing puzzles to unlock new rooms and areas, &quot;Secret Paws - Cozy Apartments&quot; is perfect for cat lovers and exploration challenge enthusiasts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to prove yourself as the ultimate cat finder?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396640/extras/be37c314c8c32a9ad237d74051f0fe84.poster.avif?t=1755299245\" width=610 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396640/extras/be37c314c8c32a9ad237d74051f0fe84.webm?t=1755299245\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396640/extras/be37c314c8c32a9ad237d74051f0fe84.mp4?t=1755299245\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Innovative 3D hidden objects</strong>: One of the few games that combines classic exploration mechanics with a 3D isometric environment.\u00a0\ud83d\ude80</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Over 1000 hidden cats</strong>: Find cats of all colors, sizes, and personalities.\u00a0\ud83d\ude3b</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenges to unlock new rooms</strong>: Solve puzzles and collect items to explore more areas.\u00a0\ud83d\udd11</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Secret cats</strong>: Discover special felines in unique hiding spots.\u00a0\ud83d\udc8e</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Detailed interactivity</strong>: Open furniture, move objects, and interact with the environment.\u00a0\u26a0\ufe0f</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hint System</strong>: Use hints to highlight a random cat when you're having trouble.\u00a0\ud83d\udd0d</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396640/extras/6ef8630a7a2f62a22fe370a17b6da9cb.poster.avif?t=1755299245\" width=610 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396640/extras/6ef8630a7a2f62a22fe370a17b6da9cb.webm?t=1755299245\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396640/extras/6ef8630a7a2f62a22fe370a17b6da9cb.mp4?t=1755299245\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find all the cats and become the best cat finder in Secret Paws - Cozy Apartments!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2705 Please add <i>Secret Paws - Cozy Apartments</i> to your Steam Wishlist!\u00a0\u2705</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396640/extras/bb066ae061ea84ba2e96e31307d42fa6.poster.avif?t=1755299245\" width=600 height=50 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396640/extras/bb066ae061ea84ba2e96e31307d42fa6.webm?t=1755299245\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396640/extras/bb066ae061ea84ba2e96e31307d42fa6.mp4?t=1755299245\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></sp